  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Where the real mapping is",
      "items": [
        "The ARC/ISA semantics are produced in the RDI SQL views, not in the converter",
        "Views already expose investigation, study, assay, contact, publication, and annotation shape",
        "Writing or changing those views is the domain work; the converter assumes that contract"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What the converter still does",
      "items": [
        "Validate view columns, stream batches, and group related rows",
        "Builder + Mapper mechanically assembles ARCtrl objects and emits RO-Crate JSON-LD",
        "That JSON is uploaded via harvest_arcs — plumbing, not mapping logic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Contract",
      "items": [
        "Authoritative view/column contract: docs/sql_to_arc_database_views.md",
        "The converter queries only those views, never raw RDI tables",
        "Failed row validation or builds never enter the upload stream"
      ]
    }
  ]
